'''Pork on Rice''' (豚丼, ''Butadon'', '''Pork Bowl''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

